{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54699","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，帆幔气堪疑。\n又若破船来向（京本作「泊」）岸，仍居乾位帝京基（辛本、川本作「隳」、京本作「堕」），帆落势倾时（京本作「危」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}